  "conclusion": "Mean H (R/S EWMA) = 0.502, H (Variogram EWMA) = 0.009. H >= 0.5, rough vol characteristics not clearly evident at daily frequency. Adding H to HAR does NOT improve QLIKE. Hurst exponent has no incremental predictive value for daily vol. Best overall model: HAR (QLIKE=1.526412). Comparison with K34: confirms that daily-frequency Hurst is challenging for vol prediction.",
